{"id":"n14224-1-7","stage":4,"title":"가출 · 离家出走","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14224-1-7-1","ko":"지수가 가출을 했대요.","zh":"听说智秀离家出走了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수가","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"가출을","meaning":"离家出走","explanation":"가출：离家出走；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"가출","audio":"/audio/e5a9c6beabb8d9fd6cb4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14224","senseId":"1","lemma":"가출","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했대요.","meaning":"表示想法或推测。","explanation":"하다：表示想法或推测。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대요：口语中礼貌地转述听来的话。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"27","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e5a9c6beabb8d9fd","term":"가출","zh":"离家出走","audio":"/audio/e5a9c6beabb8d9fd6cb4.mp3","entryId":"14224","definition":"抛弃家庭，走出家门不回来。","pronunciation":["가출"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示想法或推测。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示想法或推测。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fe0738bbdbd5ee7fc5a9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14224-1-7-2","ko":"그 착한 애가 집을 나간 거 보면 집에 무슨 일이 있나 봐요.","zh":"那个乖孩子会离开家，看来家里肯定出了什么事。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"착한","meaning":"善良","explanation":"착하다：善良；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"착하다","audio":"/audio/44db3fd508e6c9f93bd0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71732","senseId":"1","lemma":"착하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"애가","meaning":"孩子，小孩","explanation":"애：孩子，小孩；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"애","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73967","senseId":"1","lemma":"애","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집을","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나간","meaning":"离开","explanation":"나가다：离开；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"10","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보면","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일이","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"6","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있나","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐요.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"44db3fd508e6c9f9","term":"착하다","zh":"善良","audio":"/audio/44db3fd508e6c9f93bd0.mp3","entryId":"71732","definition":"心灵或行动等美好正直，十分温和。","pronunciation":["차카다"]},{"id":"a9fee06ad11f5bbd","term":"애","zh":"孩子，小孩","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3","entryId":"73967","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["애ː"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"离开","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"从某个地区或空间，或曾所属的地方出去。","pronunciation":["나가다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏；看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"所处的情形或状况。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/d98830b02c7c701b0a48.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"